Z||000000||Jackalrr||11-27-2000||05:22 PM||||On the way home from school today I noticed a HUGE difference in acceleration and power. My first thought was that the clutch was slipping. However, even while pressing the clutch and reving the engine the car begins to shake over 4000 rpms. The car also shakes when I go over 45 mph. <P>I am 99.9% positive it is not the gas, I fill it with premium and it is half way through my last fill and just now having a problem.<P>If anyone thinks they may know what the problem is please let me know.<P>BTW: It is an 85 GT with a 5 speed trans.<P>Thank you,<BR>-Charlie<BR>-----<BR>jackalrr@cinci.rr.com||||reg||5
